<clause id="boilerplate-standard-feedback" anchor="boilerplate-standard-feedback" obligation="normative" semx-id="_4b48acd6-973f-402f-97b5-d1794d313105"><p id="_cb0581b2-acf2-995c-21c5-080c40d2dfd0" semx-id="_cb0581b2-acf2-995c-21c5-080c40d2dfd0">Suggested additions, changes and comments on this document are welcome and encouraged. Such suggestions may be submitted using the online change request form on OGC web site: <link target="http://ogc.standardstracker.org/" id="_3d5eeee2-a368-9c42-8e24-5058aaf2e0d2"/><fmt-link target="http://ogc.standardstracker.org/"/></p>
