</tr><tr id="_ac684592-3333-88a0-49d5-a43cbaecc462" semx-id="_ac684592-3333-88a0-49d5-a43cbaecc462"><td id="_09d8fb3a-8bbb-b3ef-0462-741fa20e8fe7" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_09d8fb3a-8bbb-b3ef-0462-741fa20e8fe7"><strong>Temporal</strong></td>
