<p id="_384802b2-1d21-1abe-7c3d-8da6108d0d7a" semx-id="_384802b2-1d21-1abe-7c3d-8da6108d0d7a"><strong><sup>1</sup> In cases where multiple values are delivered for these elements in GeoSciML, data providers should </strong>choose<strong> one, or merge, or concatenate values into a representative single value for use in GeoSciML Lite</strong></p>

<p id="_01a98855-70a0-5db8-4aa9-c81fe3e2c657" semx-id="_01a98855-70a0-5db8-4aa9-c81fe3e2c657"><strong><sup>2</sup> Use an appropriate </strong>human readable label<strong> for the vocabulary</strong></p>

<p id="_15293daa-56ec-2041-5f28-a08457eb206a" semx-id="_15293daa-56ec-2041-5f28-a08457eb206a"><strong><sup>3</sup> Use a </strong>reference<strong> or an identifier that can be used to reach a representation.</strong></p>
</clause>

<clause id="_52010b20-5718-12c8-5ad7-1fb40e43e58e" obligation="normative" semx-id="_52010b20-5718-12c8-5ad7-1fb40e43e58e">
<title id="_4fa44b6b-8105-464d-38d3-a8115e012450" semx-id="_cd251883-1b2e-ea33-81a1-02d70738e417">identifier</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_cb48dd84-0b04-470d-133a-6df4ebc29284"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>identifier</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_ab27301b-bf22-b059-92d4-cfff46925e1e" semx-id="_ab27301b-bf22-b059-92d4-cfff46925e1e">The identifier should have the same value as the corresponding GeoSciML MappedFeature identifier, if available.</p>

<recommendation id="_22f34d58-ebb9-4788-8429-67054b6e5bfa" anchor="rec_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-identifier" model="ogc" semx-id="_f7cc8360-f300-8f55-d788-0588e74442c2" autonum="6" original-id="rec_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-identifier"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Recommendation</span> 6: <tt><xref style="id" target="rec_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-identifier">/rec/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-identifier</xref></tt></fmt-xref-label> <identifier id="_36843850-eb14-44a1-9d07-77942c9c4397">/rec/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-identifier</identifier><component class="part" semx-id="_0b1240db-66eb-d314-18bd-e4fd04f40489" original-id="_0b1240db-66eb-d314-18bd-e4fd04f40489"><p semx-id="_1a848b08-9100-7b8d-f127-7c16f07f8df4" original-id="_1a848b08-9100-7b8d-f127-7c16f07f8df4">Where possible, GeologicUnitView identifier SHOULD correspond to an instance of GeoSciML MappedFeature.</p>
</component>
<fmt-provision id="_043a6f79-f85d-b243-d6a3-aebbba2fec65"><table id="rec_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-identifier" type="recommend" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTitle"><fmt-name id="_3754f852-f67e-dfa3-086c-4692fae6703b"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Recommendation</span> 6</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Identifier</th>
<td><tt>/rec/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-identifier</tt></td>
</tr><tr><th>Included in</th><td><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirements class</span> 9: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite" id="_a781bb62-abe5-dfa8-5ea0-272624881c66">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</xref><fmt-xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</fmt-xref></tt></td></tr><tr id="_0b1240db-66eb-d314-18bd-e4fd04f40489"><th>A</th><td><p id="_1a848b08-9100-7b8d-f127-7c16f07f8df4" semx-id="_1a848b08-9100-7b8d-f127-7c16f07f8df4">Where possible, GeologicUnitView identifier SHOULD correspond to an instance of GeoSciML MappedFeature.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></recommendation>
</clause>

<clause id="_10883cfe-74ec-031a-e589-fb8d9632161e" obligation="normative" semx-id="_10883cfe-74ec-031a-e589-fb8d9632161e">
<title id="_6185c460-02b9-7824-b6c5-67b95c235dce" semx-id="_6637ad6b-bac7-2583-744d-eb0ce6064a2b">name</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_caa97bd1-9775-c282-7e04-aa93e1ac467b"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>name</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_bdf223fc-b55b-e2f0-1e2c-8f10dc5d2477" semx-id="_bdf223fc-b55b-e2f0-1e2c-8f10dc5d2477">If present, the property name:Primitive::CharacterString is a display name for the GeologicUnit.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_98bc9552-7bba-8a46-6f2e-cbf0f8fa6a6b" obligation="normative" semx-id="_98bc9552-7bba-8a46-6f2e-cbf0f8fa6a6b">
<title id="_a88f182e-32e9-1128-88ec-1f9a22f36e3e" semx-id="_a404660b-eab5-c723-9f8c-33c19975bc68">description</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_09e208dc-2da2-8cea-2ea0-bcd67c53d798"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>description</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_84c55cf6-cc3a-ccd8-fcd9-31ef25daee44" semx-id="_84c55cf6-cc3a-ccd8-fcd9-31ef25daee44">If present, the property description:Primitive::CharacterString is a description of the GeologicUnit, typically taken from an entry on a geological map legend.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_bccb2562-6e43-aff8-4c02-ae743a4009ba" obligation="normative" semx-id="_bccb2562-6e43-aff8-4c02-ae743a4009ba">
<title id="_cd6aaf14-d589-6e08-5695-fdc68fb58b16" semx-id="_000ffab2-11d9-70d8-a8f4-a5113e853aec">geologicUnitType</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_86bb826c-86dc-fa0a-d910-688a0d7712ba"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>geologicUnitType</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_f0c92092-1749-72c9-6baf-967ed35fa9d2" semx-id="_f0c92092-1749-72c9-6baf-967ed35fa9d2">If present, the property geologicUnitType (Primitive::CharacterString) contains the type of GeologicUnit (as defined in GeoSciML). To report an identifier from a controlled vocabulary, geologicUnitType_uri shall be used.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_35dd08e3-634a-27fd-2f64-42c0544b1f55" obligation="normative" semx-id="_35dd08e3-634a-27fd-2f64-42c0544b1f55">
<title id="_df5bf4b0-2710-5614-0c8e-da7698e00701" semx-id="_e7d5e217-3fdf-4ec6-2534-b3175c027099">rank</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_407e7947-df12-bd60-6ef4-4d62002b438e"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>rank</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_49c728e7-9202-6891-8fed-85076fb1294a" semx-id="_49c728e7-9202-6891-8fed-85076fb1294a">If present, the property rank:Primitive::CharacterString contain the rank of GeologicUnit (as defined by ISC. e.g., group, formation, member). </p>
</clause>

<clause id="_664d6514-679e-6d95-cc41-db65e4be48cc" obligation="normative" semx-id="_664d6514-679e-6d95-cc41-db65e4be48cc">
<title id="_e849dc4a-2686-10aa-45f8-3de1233916d6" semx-id="_5ed67cba-717f-a7f4-86c9-890ff2f2c4d0">lithology</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_be554114-1ef9-c686-84ee-793200bc4825"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>7<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>lithology</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>7</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_3ab8e3e4-5ea6-5f52-2458-4a6211eb445e" semx-id="_3ab8e3e4-5ea6-5f52-2458-4a6211eb445e">If present, lithology contains a human readable description as Primitive::CharacterString of the GeologicUnit’s lithology, possibly formatted with formal syntax (see 8.9.2.3).  The description can be language-dependent.  To report an identifier from a controlled vocabulary, representativeLithology_uri shall be used.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_5fb124ef-2ffd-7795-3dce-d9885cb707a4" obligation="normative" semx-id="_5fb124ef-2ffd-7795-3dce-d9885cb707a4">
<title id="_7383fa4e-8f33-fb84-1de5-04f42476d609" semx-id="_33334565-3598-8d72-5872-21e6fc06653f">geologicHistory</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_4428caf5-5faa-6894-e07b-9b9c4f725ab2"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>geologicHistory</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>8</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_7adc8c20-7302-313f-0abb-8eb8fe6cba27" semx-id="_7adc8c20-7302-313f-0abb-8eb8fe6cba27">If present, contains a human readable description in Primitive::CharacterString, possibly formatted with formal syntax (see 8.9.2.3), of the age of the GeologicUnit (where age is a sequence of events and may include process and environment information). To report an identifier from a controlled vocabulary, representativeAge_uri, representativeOlderAge_uri, representativeYoungerAge_uri shall be used.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_7d020a06-a7f9-4f4c-1799-173e526d3b7f" obligation="normative" semx-id="_7d020a06-a7f9-4f4c-1799-173e526d3b7f">
<title id="_0ff892db-b8bf-4d1a-1127-c13a59dfa95e" semx-id="_5962315a-027a-cd0e-9983-8a59d1009efa">numericOlderAge</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_756e2592-a6e4-e117-b60b-7c28a8d9ca28"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>numericOlderAge</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_3fe226fb-4538-f2c0-f323-5f4f66048889" semx-id="_3fe226fb-4538-f2c0-f323-5f4f66048889">If present, the property numericOlderAge age is a numerical representation (Primitive::Number) of the unit’s older age in million years (Ma).</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_5381c57b-a837-2671-1aee-1eb0262e4f33" obligation="normative" semx-id="_5381c57b-a837-2671-1aee-1eb0262e4f33">
<title id="_b6991cb2-ae73-f230-b926-a4a7a606f4db" semx-id="_5ca2cafd-5721-832b-6bc8-6c0687d4746d">numericYoungerAge</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_e6afed13-ff1f-78a9-f2cc-13f496dd2997"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>numericYoungerAge</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>10</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_dfbc74f4-4253-bdbd-652d-c0a81ae552a9" semx-id="_dfbc74f4-4253-bdbd-652d-c0a81ae552a9">If present, the property numericYoungerAge is a numerical representation (Primitive::Number) of the unit’s younger age in million years (Ma).</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_0f88b441-41d6-2b36-4b30-44d5b282c642" obligation="normative" semx-id="_0f88b441-41d6-2b36-4b30-44d5b282c642">
<title id="_6204c07f-e8a0-8607-cc6e-38e48e8826a2" semx-id="_d0d3cf0e-4c0e-f52a-977b-51be19d0c8cc">observationMethod</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_437d82c1-3ff4-cea2-ec6a-abd3461821dd"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>11<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>observationMethod</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>11</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_76034238-c07e-9b1e-c4d7-048eb4c8aadc" semx-id="_76034238-c07e-9b1e-c4d7-048eb4c8aadc">If present, the property observationMethod:Primitive::CharacterString is a metadata snippet indicating how the spatial extent of the feature was determined. ObservationMethod is a convenience property that provides a simple approach to observation metadata when data are reported using a feature view (as opposed to observation view).</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_b9739453-0a94-6162-6aec-d91b9b295ea0" obligation="normative" semx-id="_b9739453-0a94-6162-6aec-d91b9b295ea0">
<title id="_a1bca04f-5180-fc74-7d1a-c1d1c7d16a37" semx-id="_eab528ad-4d49-22f8-c66c-1d252f6cd922">positionalAccuracy</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_e5cecc65-d040-5c23-3505-bc4cdc1f2d45"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>positionalAccuracy</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_dc2f7097-25fd-4b92-e514-29ad5109d59f" semx-id="_dc2f7097-25fd-4b92-e514-29ad5109d59f">If present, the property positionalAccuracy:Primitive::CharacterString is a quantitative value (a numerical value and a unit of length) defining the radius of an uncertainty buffer around a MappedFeature (e.g., a positionalAccuracy of 100 m for a line feature defines a buffer polygon of total width 200 m centred on the line).</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_7c203e15-5601-6b69-e41d-bb40efe34726" obligation="normative" semx-id="_7c203e15-5601-6b69-e41d-bb40efe34726">
<title id="_3214bdb0-90cc-720c-57c8-b334da36a3bf" semx-id="_45436a8f-864a-8407-b701-725f00b8c2c4">source</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_4bf1495f-da34-4fc1-9bda-49487bd7391f"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>13<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>source</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>13</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_7535bcf3-49fd-6985-cc3f-ba50d2cc9310" semx-id="_7535bcf3-49fd-6985-cc3f-ba50d2cc9310">If present, the property source:Primitive::CharacterString is human readable text describing feature-specific details and citations to source materials, and if available provides URLs to reference material and publications describing the geologic feature. This could be a short text synopsis of key information that would also be in the metadata record referenced by metadata_uri.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_095127ac-6dd3-0324-77bc-495640ae0b47" obligation="normative" semx-id="_095127ac-6dd3-0324-77bc-495640ae0b47">
<title id="_9b19924c-7604-3887-7480-6e81646954bb" semx-id="_0f53c44e-3536-05d1-e984-1ec30bf39ff3">geologicUnitType_uri</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_c158abe3-31a8-c850-ae01-2cedd3c8afa7"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>14<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>geologicUnitType_uri</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>14</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_aac89e8a-6a65-92b6-05ff-38ea7ab0e6ea" semx-id="_aac89e8a-6a65-92b6-05ff-38ea7ab0e6ea">The property geologicUnitType_uri:Primitive::CharacterString contains a URI referring to a controlled concept from a vocabulary defining the GeologicUnit types.</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_ca9a2960-c5a9-4be5-fe7d-5404b96ed707" obligation="normative" semx-id="_ca9a2960-c5a9-4be5-fe7d-5404b96ed707">
<title id="_6098c741-3d3c-3aff-5f5b-43efd9d0299e" semx-id="_df020555-d410-1325-3900-f994d7e532cd">representativeLithology_uri</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_35c11c5f-aceb-0d38-97e3-450cf6d5ab66"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>15<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>representativeLithology_uri</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>15</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_7558ab95-e4e3-f3a5-a5d8-be9aeae4e739" semx-id="_7558ab95-e4e3-f3a5-a5d8-be9aeae4e739">The property representativeLithology_uri:Primitive::CharacterString shall contain a URI referring to a controlled concept specifying the characteristic or representative lithology of the unit. This may be a concept that defines the super-type of all lithology values present within a GeologicUnit or a concept defining the lithology of the dominant CompositionPart (as defined in GeoSciML) of the unit.</p>

<requirement id="_abbf38c5-9b68-4d50-9f68-59b746f5643d" anchor="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeLithology" model="ogc" semx-id="_135c8588-b7bd-4980-1781-164628c449e8" autonum="44" original-id="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeLithology"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 44: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeLithology">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeLithology</xref></tt></fmt-xref-label> <identifier id="_3a673ba4-69c7-483c-9649-d0034222fa13">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeLithology</identifier><component class="part" semx-id="_a1d5b840-445d-8464-3290-4bf478031f97" original-id="_a1d5b840-445d-8464-3290-4bf478031f97"><p semx-id="_37769030-5187-4b35-f682-d10fad0bd047" original-id="_37769030-5187-4b35-f682-d10fad0bd047">representativeLithology_uri value SHALL refer to a controlled concept specifying the characteristic or representative lithology of the unit. This may be a concept that defines the super-type of all lithology values present within a GeologicUnit or a concept defining the lithology of the dominant CompositionPart (as defined in GeoSciML) of the unit.</p>
</component>
<fmt-provision id="_c94e18ab-75c9-4333-258c-cb510467a24d"><table id="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeLithology" type="recommend" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTitle"><fmt-name id="_61e188f1-d4ee-c4fd-aac2-c7d6ea5a666e"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 44</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Identifier</th>
<td><tt>/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeLithology</tt></td>
</tr><tr><th>Included in</th><td><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirements class</span> 9: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite" id="_73a75dc4-72f2-f9e8-4b0c-0222d5d273d2">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</xref><fmt-xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</fmt-xref></tt></td></tr><tr id="_a1d5b840-445d-8464-3290-4bf478031f97"><th>A</th><td><p id="_37769030-5187-4b35-f682-d10fad0bd047" semx-id="_37769030-5187-4b35-f682-d10fad0bd047">representativeLithology_uri value SHALL refer to a controlled concept specifying the characteristic or representative lithology of the unit. This may be a concept that defines the super-type of all lithology values present within a GeologicUnit or a concept defining the lithology of the dominant CompositionPart (as defined in GeoSciML) of the unit.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>
</clause>

<clause id="_9c5291ee-4a64-69ac-2075-64e752c9484a" obligation="normative" semx-id="_9c5291ee-4a64-69ac-2075-64e752c9484a">
<title id="_17342d50-4378-ba17-1063-25b8d6cc2305" semx-id="_97999725-f5dc-f76d-c068-2582fa8b2d46">representativeAge_uri</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_9a5c3baa-48a0-e19d-6bdf-eecfd228a253"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>16<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>representativeAge_uri</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>16</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_23ce0818-5f51-3a5a-7f37-5deb5c8ed7b9" semx-id="_23ce0818-5f51-3a5a-7f37-5deb5c8ed7b9">The property representativeAge_uri:Primitive::CharacterString shall  contain a URI referring to a controlled concept specifying the most representative stratigraphic age interval for the GeologicUnit. This will be defined entirely at the discretion of the data provider and may be a single event selected from the geologic feature’s geological history or a value summarising the all or part of the feature’s history.</p>

<requirement id="_efe03d4a-7719-4bba-893d-405afe3b0d2e" anchor="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeAge" model="ogc" semx-id="_00f762be-6279-2c4b-fa33-58b3821bcea4" autonum="45" original-id="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeAge"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 45: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeAge">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeAge</xref></tt></fmt-xref-label> <identifier id="_d4fa0715-2179-4f09-b3ff-f5ff106958ca">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeAge</identifier><component class="part" semx-id="_4476bfe3-0510-f9ce-3b3c-1b0bfe76e9cf" original-id="_4476bfe3-0510-f9ce-3b3c-1b0bfe76e9cf"><p semx-id="_b894ae04-dd74-3554-6784-f40b70c091e4" original-id="_b894ae04-dd74-3554-6784-f40b70c091e4">representativeAge_uri value SHALL refer to a controlled concept specifying the most representative stratigraphic age interval for the GeologicUnit. This will be defined entirely at the discretion of the data provider and may be a single event selected from the geologic feature’s geological history or a value summarising the all or part of the feature’s history.</p>
</component>
<fmt-provision id="_3e5a2a7a-bee8-2666-9bf0-4136efa5ec4f"><table id="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeAge" type="recommend" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTitle"><fmt-name id="_67e34e79-7a2a-3845-f56b-6560a8404f30"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 45</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Identifier</th>
<td><tt>/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeAge</tt></td>
</tr><tr><th>Included in</th><td><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirements class</span> 9: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite" id="_ebf7e025-4874-52fb-d6a7-d45e2eadc5f3">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</xref><fmt-xref style="id" target="req_class_gsml-lite">{spec-part1-uri}/req/gsml-lite</fmt-xref></tt></td></tr><tr id="_4476bfe3-0510-f9ce-3b3c-1b0bfe76e9cf"><th>A</th><td><p id="_b894ae04-dd74-3554-6784-f40b70c091e4" semx-id="_b894ae04-dd74-3554-6784-f40b70c091e4">representativeAge_uri value SHALL refer to a controlled concept specifying the most representative stratigraphic age interval for the GeologicUnit. This will be defined entirely at the discretion of the data provider and may be a single event selected from the geologic feature’s geological history or a value summarising the all or part of the feature’s history.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>
</clause>

<clause id="_a53d2545-c535-8f0f-7e66-0519189f51e8" obligation="normative" semx-id="_a53d2545-c535-8f0f-7e66-0519189f51e8">
<title id="_8fc4d6ad-a804-dffc-5e88-7809ec375c18" semx-id="_e45e91ac-d03c-3c19-31a9-0e5f2d136e1d">representativeOlderAge_uri</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_65deb551-63f2-721d-dba5-ef12c8bbe6f9"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>17<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span>representativeOlderAge_uri</fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>9<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>17</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_db427a73-9725-3e98-d324-fa5482e06cff" semx-id="_db427a73-9725-3e98-d324-fa5482e06cff">The property representativeOlderAge_uri:Primitive::CharacterString shall contain a URI referring to a controlled concept specifying the most representative older value in a range of stratigraphic age intervals for the GeologicUnit. This will be defined entirely at the discretion of the data provider and may be a single event selected from the geologic feature’s geological history or a value summarising the all or part of the feature’s history.</p>

<requirement id="_793ce9e4-b755-4571-b754-b8fd7fc4f38c" anchor="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeOlderAge" model="ogc" semx-id="_d94337ab-af8e-05e3-0728-dc8168ff4974" autonum="46" original-id="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeOlderAge"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 46: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_gsml-lite_geologicunitview-representativeOlderAge">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeOlderAge</xref></tt></fmt-xref-label> <identifier id="_129a1321-332b-496b-ba12-cd4e4439ae30">/req/gsml-lite/geologicunitview-representativeOlderAge</identifier><component class="part" semx-id="_995a180d-73c2-fd7e-cbbe-07851aa1ad9e" original-id="_995a180d-73c2-fd7e-cbbe-07851aa1ad9e"><p semx-id="_72a3f79f-595c-8275-74bb-6cb00391bae5" original-id="_72a3f79f-595c-8275-74bb-6cb00391bae5">representativeOlderAge_uri value SHALL refer to a controlled concept specifying the most representative older value in a range of stratigraphic age intervals for the GeologicUnit. This will be defined entirely at the discretion of the data provider and may be a single event selected from the geologic feature’s geological history or a value summarising the all or part of the feature’s history.</p>
</component>
