</tr><tr><th>Requirements class</th><td>/req/gsml-conceptual</td></tr><tr><th>Conformance test</th><td id="_97e33d2f-c01a-570a-57c3-1c8431d54fdf"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1: <tt><xref style="id" target="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity" id="_269faa37-8ff5-a77a-7500-bbabd79969d6">/conf/gsml-conceptual/similarity</xref><fmt-xref style="id" target="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity">/conf/gsml-conceptual/similarity</fmt-xref></tt></span></td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>

<requirement id="_c137811a-a4e2-4380-b545-6a0c4a128b19" anchor="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity" model="ogc" type="abstracttest" semx-id="_af25265a-2e79-5547-4359-fb0cb218a5d5" autonum="A.1" original-id="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1: <tt><xref style="id" target="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity">/conf/gsml-conceptual/similarity</xref></tt></fmt-xref-label> <identifier id="_ba0dbb29-cb24-4673-8911-662b646e93c2">/conf/gsml-conceptual/similarity</identifier><classification><tag>target</tag><value id="_f2f675b8-1815-4eb5-8e67-a6904637ac03">/req/gsml-conceptual/similarity</value></classification><component class="test-purpose" semx-id="_8770dae4-9442-6979-6a36-34658d750048" original-id="_8770dae4-9442-6979-6a36-34658d750048"><p semx-id="_3a460174-2b89-62f5-a6d0-66b998d9532b" original-id="_3a460174-2b89-62f5-a6d0-66b998d9532b">Ensure that the target logical model is compatible with the conceptual model.</p>
</component><component class="test-method" semx-id="_20f3f932-f34d-fe3f-656b-46d2cff3a168" original-id="_20f3f932-f34d-fe3f-656b-46d2cff3a168"><p semx-id="_3c14e177-f432-042f-b010-639ac343fdd4" original-id="_3c14e177-f432-042f-b010-639ac343fdd4">Determine semantic similarity between the logical model and conceptual model using an established method such as: (i) visual comparison of the UML diagrams, (ii) comparison of logical and conceptual components expressed in a common knowledge representation language such as first order logic, or (iii) comparison after mapping to a reference ontology.</p>
</component>
<fmt-provision id="_95e74156-37e5-1076-e1ee-9267b32b0593"><table id="conf_gsml-conceptual_similarity" type="recommendtest" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTestTitle"><fmt-name id="_215dd2d3-b9fd-02be-53f7-49fc919595c5"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Identifier</th>
<td><tt>/conf/gsml-conceptual/similarity</tt></td>
</tr><tr><th>Requirement</th><td><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirement</span> 1: <tt><xref style="id" target="req_gsml_conceptual_similarity" id="_9403e8de-2ae3-1ba0-0872-e0619863a8c6">/req/gsml-conceptual/similarity</xref><fmt-xref style="id" target="req_gsml_conceptual_similarity">/req/gsml-conceptual/similarity</fmt-xref></tt></td></tr><tr id="_8770dae4-9442-6979-6a36-34658d750048"><th>Test purpose</th><td><p id="_3a460174-2b89-62f5-a6d0-66b998d9532b" semx-id="_3a460174-2b89-62f5-a6d0-66b998d9532b">Ensure that the target logical model is compatible with the conceptual model.</p>
</td></tr><tr id="_20f3f932-f34d-fe3f-656b-46d2cff3a168"><th>Test method</th><td><p id="_3c14e177-f432-042f-b010-639ac343fdd4" semx-id="_3c14e177-f432-042f-b010-639ac343fdd4">Determine semantic similarity between the logical model and conceptual model using an established method such as: (i) visual comparison of the UML diagrams, (ii) comparison of logical and conceptual components expressed in a common knowledge representation language such as first order logic, or (iii) comparison after mapping to a reference ontology.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>
</clause>

